        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Costume trimming, shaped ribbon. The ribbon has a slight meander, having curved edges composed of small cusps on larger, staggered cusps. These edges are in silver or silver-gilt and the ribbon, of plain blue satin, contains spots of the same metal, wound on a white silk core."@en , "Costume trimming silk ribbon, France, 1820-1850."@en ;
